<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>EssentoLabs - Welcome Aboard!</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');

        * { box-sizing: border-box; }

        body {
            font-family: 'DM Sans', Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #2d1f3d;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f3eefa;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 560px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(64, 0, 96, 0.10);
        }

        /* ── Header ── */
        .header {
            background: #400060;
            padding: 32px 24px 28px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .logo-mark {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 44px;
            height: 44px;
            background: #9009D3;
            border-radius: 12px;
            line-height: 44px;
            font-size: 22px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #ffffff;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .header p {
            margin: 6px 0 0;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #BC7DD8;
            letter-spacing: 0.3px;
        }

        /* ── Content ── */
        .content {
            padding: 32px 28px 24px;
        }

        .welcome-icon {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 48px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .content h2 {
            margin: 0 0 10px;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #400060;
        }

        .content p {
            margin: 0 0 20px;
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #4a3360;
        }

        /* ── CTA Box ── */
        .cta-container {
            background: #f3eefa;
            border: 1.5px solid #DCD4FD;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 24px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 24px 0;
        }

        .cta-container h3 {
            margin: 0 0 6px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #400060;
        }

        .cta-container p {
            margin: 0 0 16px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #7936A2;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #800080;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            padding: 13px 36px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.3px;
        }

        /* ── Features Grid ── */
        .features-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 14px;
            margin: 20px 0 28px;
        }

        .feature {
            background: #f3eefa;
            border: 1px solid #ede8f5;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 18px 14px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .feature-icon {
            font-size: 26px;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .feature h3 {
            margin: 0 0 6px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #400060;
        }

        .feature p {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #7936A2;
        }

        /* ── Steps ── */
        .steps {
            background: #f3eefa;
            border: 1px solid #ede8f5;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 20px 18px;
            margin: 0 0 24px;
        }

        .steps h3 {
            margin: 0 0 16px;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #400060;
        }

        .step {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .step:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        .step-number {
            background: #800080;
            color: #ffffff;
            width: 30px;
            height: 30px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-right: 14px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .step strong {
            display: block;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #400060;
            margin-bottom: 2px;
        }

        .step p {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #7936A2;
        }

        /* ── Divider ── */
        .divider {
            border: none;
            border-top: 1px solid #ede8f5;
            margin: 24px 0;
        }

        /* ── Footer ── */
        .footer {
            background: #f3eefa;
            padding: 20px 28px;
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 1px solid #ede8f5;
        }

        .footer p {
            margin: 4px 0;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #8B62A8;
        }

        .footer .brand {
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #7936A2;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        .social-links {
            margin: 10px 0 4px;
        }

        .social-links a {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #7936A2;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        /* ── Responsive ── */
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .container {
                margin: 12px;
                border-radius: 12px;
            }
            .content {
                padding: 24px 18px 18px;
            }
            .features-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .footer {
                padding: 16px 18px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">

        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="header">
            <div class="logo-mark">⚡</div>
            <h1>EssentoLabs</h1>
            <p>Freelancer &amp; Client Workspace</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Body -->
        <div class="content">
            <div class="welcome-icon">🎉</div>

            <h2>Welcome, <%= userName %>!</h2>

            <p>We're thrilled to have you on board. Your <strong>EssentoLabs</strong> account is ready — the smarter way to connect freelancers and clients, manage projects, and get work done.</p>

            <div class="cta-container">
                <h3>Ready to get started?</h3>
                <p>Head to your dashboard and set up your profile.</p>
                <a href="#" class="btn">Go to Dashboard</a>
            </div>

            <h3 style="color:#400060; font-size:15px; margin:0 0 14px;">What you can do with EssentoLabs:</h3>

            <div class="features-grid">
                <div class="feature">
                    <span class="feature-icon">💼</span>
                    <h3>Post Projects</h3>
                    <p>Share work opportunities and attract top freelancers</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature">
                    <span class="feature-icon">🔍</span>
                    <h3>Find Talent</h3>
                    <p>Browse verified freelancers across all skill sets</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature">
                    <span class="feature-icon">💬</span>
                    <h3>Collaborate</h3>
                    <p>Chat, share files, and manage tasks in one place</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature">
                    <span class="feature-icon">💳</span>
                    <h3>Secure Payments</h3>
                    <p>Protected transactions with milestone-based billing</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="steps">
                <h3>Quick Start Guide</h3>
                <div class="step">
                    <div class="step-number">1</div>
                    <div>
                        <strong>Complete your profile</strong>
                        <p>Add your skills, bio, and portfolio to stand out</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="step">
                    <div class="step-number">2</div>
                    <div>
                        <strong>Browse or post a project</strong>
                        <p>Find work or hire the right person for your needs</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="step">
                    <div class="step-number">3</div>
                    <div>
                        <strong>Start collaborating</strong>
                        <p>Connect, agree on terms, and get things done</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <p style="margin:0 0 20px; font-size:14px;">Have questions? Our support team is always here to help you get the most out of EssentoLabs.</p>

            <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 8px;">
                <a href="#" class="btn">View Getting Started Guide</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="footer">
            <p class="brand">EssentoLabs</p>
            <p>Thank you for joining — we're excited to see what you'll build.</p>
            <div class="social-links">
                <a href="#">Website</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;
                <a href="#">Documentation</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;
                <a href="#">Contact Support</a>
            </div>
            <p style="margin-top:8px;">© EssentoLabs — All rights reserved</p>
        </div>

    </div>
</body>
</html>